The published animap.json is made available under the ODbL 1.0 (LICENSE-DATA), its contents under the DbCL 1.0. It contains information from AniDB (https://anidb.net): which episodes exist, with their kind, number and AniDB episode id, the anime types and the MyAnimeList links; AniDB's data is licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. TVDB data is provided by TheTVDB (https://thetvdb.com): the series ids, season and episode numbers and episode ids. The TMDB movie ids are from TMDB (https://www.themoviedb.org). This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB. The AniList ids are from AniList (https://anilist.co). The mapping started from earlier releases of this file, so it still contains information from anime-offline-database (https://github.com/cedya77/anime-offline-database, ODbL 1.0 and DbCL 1.0), which gave the initial AniList links, and from Anime-Lists (https://github.com/Anime-Lists/anime-lists), which gave the initial TheTVDB, TMDB and IMDb mappings.
